mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{dynamic}} \\propto f_{\\text{CLK}} \\Rightarrow \\text{降频线性降低动态功耗}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dynamic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CLK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降频线性降低动态功耗</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>节省比例</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局降频</td>\n<td>降低 SYSCLK</td>\n<td>与频率成正比</td>\n<td>所有任务减速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外设按需降频</td>\n<td>调整 APB 分频</td>\n<td>外设相关部分</td>\n<td>通信波特率需重配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关闭未用时钟</td>\n<td>RCC 寄存器清位</td>\n<td>该外设功耗归零</td>\n<td>外设停止响应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"睡眠策略设计\">睡眠策略设计</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Active: 事件唤醒&#10;    Active --&gt; Sleep: 主循环空闲&#10;    Sleep --&gt; Active: 任意中断&#10;    Active --&gt; Stop: 长时间无任务&#10;    Stop --&gt; Active: RTC/EXTI 唤醒&#10;    Active --&gt; Standby: 超长空闲&#10;    Standby --&gt; Active: WKUP/RTC 唤醒\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Active: 事件唤醒\n    Active --&gt; Sleep: 主循环空闲\n    Sleep --&gt; Active: 任意中断\n    Active --&gt; Stop: 长时间无任务\n    Stop --&gt; Active: RTC/EXTI 唤醒\n    Active --&gt; Standby: 超长空闲\n    Standby --&gt; Active: WKUP/RTC 唤醒</pre><p>功耗预算示例（CR2032 纽扣电池，225 mAh）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作模式</th>\n<th>电流</th>\n<th>占空比</th>\n<th>等效电流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>活动（168 MHz）</td>\n<td>50 mA</td>\n<td>0.1%</td>\n<td>50 μA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sleep（外设运行）</td>\n<td>5 mA</td>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>50 μA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop（SRAM 保持）</td>\n<td>10 μA</td>\n<td>98.9%</td>\n<td>9.89 μA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>加权平均</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><strong>~110 μA</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>battery</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>225</mn><mtext> mAh</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>0.11</mn><mtext> mA</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>2045</mn><mtext> 小时</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>85</mn><mtext> 天</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{battery}} = \\frac{225 \\text{ mAh}}{0.11 \\text{ mA}} \\approx 2045 \\text{ 小时} \\approx 85 \\text{ 天}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">battery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.11</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> mA</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">225</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> mAh</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2045</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小时</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"外设功耗管理\">外设功耗管理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>外设</th>\n<th>空闲功耗</th>\n<th>管理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADC</td>\n<td>~1 mA</td>\n<td>转换后关闭，需要时重新校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PLL</td>\n<td>~200 μA</td>\n<td>切到 HSI 后关闭 PLL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USB</td>\n<td>~3 mA</td>\n<td>无连接时挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UART</td>\n<td>~100 μA</td>\n<td>使用 DMA + IDLE 中断唤醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIO 未用引脚</td>\n<td>~10 μA/引脚</td>\n<td>配置为模拟输入（最低漏电）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时性优化\">实时性优化</h2><h3 id=\"中断延迟优化\">中断延迟优化</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>response</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>HW_latency</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ISR_execution</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>task_switch</mtext></msub><mtext>（若需切换）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{response}} = T_{\\text{HW\\_latency}} + T_{\\text{ISR\\_execution}} + T_{\\text{task\\_switch}}（若需切换）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">response</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HW_latency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ISR_execution</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task_switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（若需切换）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优化方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化措施</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减少临界区长度</td>\n<td>降低中断屏蔽时间</td>\n<td>细粒度锁、无锁算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISR 分级</td>\n<td>快速响应+延迟处理</td>\n<td>上半部设标志、下半部处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中断优先级分配</td>\n<td>关键中断不被阻塞</td>\n<td>高于 RTOS SYSCALL 优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flash 预取</td>\n<td>减少取指等待</td>\n<td>使能 ART Accelerator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SRAM 执行 ISR</td>\n<td>消除 Flash 延迟</td>\n<td>链接脚本指定段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"确定性时序验证\">确定性时序验证</h3><p>使用 GPIO+示波器验证关键中断的响应时间分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>抖动</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>min</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{抖动} = T_{\\text{max}} - T_{\\text{min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抖动</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n<th>超标处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均响应时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 目标的 50%</td>\n<td>余量充足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大响应时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 硬截止期</td>\n<td>必须保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抖动</td>\n<td>&lt; 目标的 10%</td>\n<td>检查竞争源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具链与工作流\">工具链与工作流</h2><h3 id=\"性能分析工具\">性能分析工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Ozone</td>\n<td>SEGGER</td>\n<td>图形化 profiler + 时间线</td>\n<td>商用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SystemView</td>\n<td>SEGGER</td>\n<td>RTOS 可视化分析</td>\n<td>免费（非商用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STM32CubeMonitor</td>\n<td>ST</td>\n<td>实时变量监控</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tracealyzer</td>\n<td>Percepio</td>\n<td>RTOS 跟踪回放分析</td>\n<td>商用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>μC/Probe</td>\n<td>Micrium</td>\n<td>运行时数据仪表盘</td>\n<td>商用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>测量方法</strong>：DWT CYCCNT 提供单周期精度且侵入性极低，GPIO 翻转配示波器适合并行事件，SWO Profiler 与 RTOS 统计适合长时间分布分析。</li>\n<li><strong>测量陷阱</strong>：中断会污染 CYCCNT 结果，需屏蔽中断或多次取最小值，并结合 DWT 异常跟踪补偿 ISR 时间。</li>\n<li><strong>代码优化</strong>：按阶段选择 -O0/-Og/-O2/-O3/-Os；查表、循环展开、定点化和 SRAM 执行等针对关键路径提效，但都要权衡 Flash/RAM 开销。</li>\n<li><strong>功耗设计</strong>：动态功耗正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^2 f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，降频、关时钟与三级睡眠按需压低平均电流；功耗预算表把各模式等效电流加权后可估算电池续航。</li>\n<li><strong>实时性保障</strong>：中断延迟由硬件延迟、ISR 执行与任务切换构成，通过缩短临界区、ISR 分级和关键中断优先级分配优化，并用抖动指标验证确定性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能分析与功耗优化","id":"性能分析与功耗优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"性能分析方法论","id":"性能分析方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"DWT 精确计时","id":"dwt-精确计时"},{"level":3,"text":"CYCCNT 使用方法","id":"cyccnt-使用方法"},{"level":3,"text":"中断对测量的影响","id":"中断对测量的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"代码优化策略","id":"代码优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"编译器优化级别","id":"编译器优化级别"},{"level":3,"text":"关键路径优化技术","id":"关键路径优化技术"},{"level":3,"text":"数据对齐与缓存优化","id":"数据对齐与缓存优化"},{"level":2,"text":"功耗优化","id":"功耗优化"},{"level":3,"text":"功耗剖析","id":"功耗剖析"},{"level":3,"text":"降频策略","id":"降频策略"},{"level":3,"text":"睡眠策略设计","id":"睡眠策略设计"},{"level":3,"text":"外设功耗管理","id":"外设功耗管理"},{"level":2,"text":"实时性优化","id":"实时性优化"},{"level":3,"text":"中断延迟优化","id":"中断延迟优化"},{"level":3,"text":"确定性时序验证","id":"确定性时序验证"},{"level":2,"text":"工具链与工作流","id":"工具链与工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"性能分析工具","id":"性能分析工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JTAG/SWD 调试原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/jtag-swd-debugging"},"next":{"title":"固件安全与 OTA 更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/firmware-security-ota"}}